# Host-card: meta-repo path (prompts / HISTORICO / overlay)

This window is a **host-card** workspace. The meta-repo root in the workspace is
the folder named **`git`** (this card’s meta worktree), not `~/git`.

Edits that would hit `~/git/...` outside the workspace trigger Cursor permission
prompts. Do **not** write there.

## Resolve paths (Olie, Locav, Televisão)

When a prompt or habit says `~/git/...`, write under this workspace’s **`git/`**
folder instead:

| Prompt / habit path | Edit here (host-card) |
| --- | --- |
| `~/git/olie/prompts/…` | `git/olie/prompts/…` |
| `~/git/locav/prompts/…` | `git/locav/prompts/…` |
| `~/git/televisao/prompts/…` | `git/televisao/prompts/…` |
| `~/git/HISTORICO.md` | `git/HISTORICO.md` |
| `~/git/olie/overlay/…` (and locav/televisao overlay) | `git/<project>/overlay/…` |
| `~/git/.cursor/rules/…` | `git/.cursor/rules/…` |

Absolute form to avoid: `/home/**/git/olie/prompts/…`, `/home/**/git/locav/…`,
`/home/**/git/televisao/…`, bare `~/git/olie/…` while this card workspace is open.

## Still allowed

- **Read** `~/git` if needed for comparison.
- Run **binaries** from `~/git/bin/…` (`workvm-host-card`, `workvm-sandbox`, …).
- Edit **product** worktrees that are already workspace roots (`api-main`,
  `olie-fronts`, …) — those are not the meta-repo path issue.

Same idea as **host-card-e2e-path** (private e2e under workspace `olie-e2e`, not
`~/git/olie/olie-e2e`).
